                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c1ee0ba5-9f14-3e15-a1cf-0330ebeaa297",
                        "entry_id": "a68c0d11-e9f1-36bc-a57d-d585d5b2c700",
                        "glosses": [
                            "nazwa piętnastej litery alfabetu greckiego, ο"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8d597190-776e-4984-846a-ffce8b9dac73",
                        "source_entry_id": "a68c0d11-e9f1-36bc-a57d-d585d5b2c700",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1ee0ba5-9f14-3e15-a1cf-0330ebeaa297",
                        "target_lang_word": "omicron",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "omicron",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5980a5c8-a6f5-3874-8904-9ca11ce29e46",
                                        "entry_id": "05a6c825-abb1-3faf-a8bf-0f21aa4f43c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The 15th letter of the Classical and Modern Greek alphabets (16th in Ancient and Old Greek), used in ordering lists as in naming (astronomy) the 15th star of a constellation or (epidemiology) the 15th discovered major variant of a disease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "capitalized",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98eaf2d9-40b6-4acd-9697-50af0c80fbd9",
                                                "sense_id": "5980a5c8-a6f5-3874-8904-9ca11ce29e46",
                                                "text": "Your Majestie knows that unfortunate I [...] was the first who when I published my Poem of Italia Liberata endeavoured to bring the Omicron, Eupselon, Omega, and other Greek Letters, which I thought very requisite for that language, into my own Tongue;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd619201-1cf7-45a4-9953-42146e65ff81",
                                                "sense_id": "5980a5c8-a6f5-3874-8904-9ca11ce29e46",
                                                "text": "The E serves both for the Epsilon and Eta; the O, both for the Omicron and Omega, and likewise for the dipthong OΥ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cc32e46-59c8-4712-9e21-6c8de34d6254",
                                                "sense_id": "5980a5c8-a6f5-3874-8904-9ca11ce29e46",
                                                "text": "... They include Mira itself (omicron Ceti) which can be seen shortly before dawn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6571de71-6ddc-461a-a2cd-bb160b3ae4df",
                                                "sense_id": "5980a5c8-a6f5-3874-8904-9ca11ce29e46",
                                                "text": "There are now seven “variants of interest” or “variants of concern” and they each have a Greek letter, according to a W.H.O. tracking page. Some other variants with Greek letters do not reach those classification levels, and the W.H.O. also skipped two letters just before Omicron — “Nu” and “Xi” — leading to speculation about whether “Xi” was avoided in deference to the Chinese president, Xi Jinping."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "omicron",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67e1d1ea-a384-3b0f-b054-7f9ef002a8fd",
                                        "entry_id": "f825b5fd-65e2-3007-a45b-32ad62f23663",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of Omicron variant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "006f8e7b-aea4-4a44-8c51-90d27b28ee4e",
                        "source_entry_id": "a68c0d11-e9f1-36bc-a57d-d585d5b2c700",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1ee0ba5-9f14-3e15-a1cf-0330ebeaa297",
                        "target_lang_word": "omicron",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "omicron",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adb92162-d8d9-39d5-9ee5-8edf24653f85",
                                        "entry_id": "e3336285-980e-37e3-b9b2-2bff45290636",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ο, Ο, quinzième lettre et cinquième voyelle de l’alphabet grec."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "905e9a30-e85a-4574-ac82-04f9a36f0efc",
                                                "sense_id": "adb92162-d8d9-39d5-9ee5-8edf24653f85",
                                                "text": "Le mot Sabaoth, lorsqu’il prend l’oméga grec dans sa dernière syllabe, signifie la volonté suprême ; mais, lorsqu’il ne prend que l’omicron, alors il désigne le premier ciel. Il en est de même du mot Jaôth, qui, avec l’oméga et l’aspiration à sa dernière syllabe, désigne une mesure déterminée ; et, lorsqu’il prend l’omicron, désigne celui qui éloigne les maux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07a3bc00-7b02-49f4-99a8-636412a374a6",
                                                "sense_id": "adb92162-d8d9-39d5-9ee5-8edf24653f85",
                                                "text": "Les fables sont disposées par ordre alphabétique, d’après la première lettre du premier vers de chacune. Or, nous les lisons toutes sans interruption, depuis l’alpha jusqu’à l’omicron inclusivement ; et il y en a quatre qui commencent par l’omicron."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
